{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"screens\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"弱化了核心追问：他不甘心的是，难道不再忍受委屈就必须连过去的好日子也一起失去？观众主要将其概括成怀念自在生活、提醒自己不要忘记受过的气。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"把往后遇到难事时回忆不能替他承担，偏成了回忆无法解决未来的孤独；另外漏掉了他虽然怀念，却明确没有想回头。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"score\": 4,\n      \"wrong\": \"无\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"score\": 3,\n      \"wrong\": \"将先是兴奋地向前冲、随后冲劲退去并担心等待漫长的情绪起伏，概括得偏平和，弱化了其中的激动、疲惫和不安。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"story\": 4,\n  \"story_note\": \"全曲主线基本完全一致：离开后怀念曾经被接纳和陪伴的日子，在孤独与受过的委屈之间反复挣扎，最终不为陪伴而委屈自己，带着对亲近的向往继续生活。局部情绪有所简化，但没有改变故事的核心。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2b2fcd12-4686-4d68-b057-5978880cb5e3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T194957956693Z", "elapsed_seconds": 233.046, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T19:53:51.028060+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "h